\ by-rfl on a goal that is an equation only after whnf (plan 9.4.8l, the
\ rfl items; tests/front/s2-proofs.lean): Lean's rfl macro decides an
\ equation by eq_refl, whose MVarId.refl reads the goal through whnf
\ (getType'), so id (a = a) closes with @Eq.refl.{1} Nat a, node for node
\ Lean's term.
\ Lean: theorem rfl_id (a : Nat) : id (a = a) := by rfl
theorem rfl_id
  Nat explicit: a
  a a = id
:= by
  by-rfl
end rfl_id
